      {
        "text": "An excellent choice! We are about to mint the very first Macro Node in our global library, and \"OSINT-Joe\" has a fantastic ring to it. \n\nTo bring OSINT-Joe to life, we need to map out his \"brain\" \u2014 basically, what specialized agents he contains and how they pass information to one another. \n\nSince he's an Open-Source Intelligence node, I'm picturing a flow something like this:\n\n1. **The Scout** (Agent): Takes a target or keyword and gathers initial surface-level data.\n2. **The Deep-Diver** (Agent): Takes the Scout's findings and runs targeted queries to find hidden connections or niche sources.\n3. **The Analyst** (Agent): Synthesizes everything into a clean, actionable intelligence dossier.\n\nHow are you visualizing OSINT-Joe? Tell me what kind of tasks you want him to tackle, or if you already have specific agents and a workflow in mind, lay it on me! Once we have the concept dialed in, I'll draft up the execution topology for your approval."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
