      {
        "text": "Lets use three existing agents, OSINT_Analyst, Regular_Joe, and Synthesizer. OSINT_Analyst should read the payload and provide its report to Regular_Joe, Joe will provide a response that should go back to OSINT and OSINT will provide a response back to Regular_Joe, this conversation should continue for 2 more turns and will end on Regular_Joe. This will be a GroupDialogRunner topology node whose output will be provided to the next node."
